<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54506" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταμέμφομαι</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μέμψομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					p.74J.
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				Pass.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εμέμφθην</span> in act. sense, Pi <i><span class="en">
				<u>N.</u>
				11.30
			</span></i>; also in pass. sense, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				5357.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(v A. D.)</span>:—<i>find fault with</i>; esp.
			with a sense of <i>distrust in oneself</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχύν</span> Pi.l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν δύναμιν τὴν σφετέραν αὐτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					15.61
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.110
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφᾶς αὐτούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.106
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				22.27
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμαυτόν, ὡς . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Men.</u>
					71b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἐμαυτοῦ ἡλικίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					29.1
				</span></i>
			: more generally, <i>blame, censure</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν τυραννίδα ἔν τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Hier.</u>
					8.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἱστορίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					20.43
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑμᾶς αὐτοὺς ταῖς ξυμφοραῖς</span>
			<i>blame for . . </i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.77
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.87.4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Dio</u>
				8
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				147
			</span></i> (v.l.), <i><span class="en">
				Nicom.
				<u>Exc.</u>
				4
			</span></i> (v.l.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅτι . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					15.6
				</span></i>
			: c. dat. rei, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.57
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longus
				2.21
			</span></i>, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Philopatr.</u>
				27
			</span></i>; <i>disparage</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σωκράτην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Piet.</u>
					77
				</span></i>
			.</div>
